  "verseCount": 44,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "10",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "EZR 10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "10",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Enkitobirata pee eishieki enkiyama nayama Isiraeli o loreren",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore eomonito Esra neirridu, neishir, nenang'ie kewan enkop te dukuya enkaji o Laitoriani, neiturrurrokino ninye eumata sapuk oo lewa, o nkituaak o nkera, eing'uaa Israel, amu eishira lelo tung'ana te mion. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore Shekamia olayioni le Yehiel, loo layiok le Elam, neirorie Esra: ajoki, “Kinturraitie iyiook enkirukoto te Nkai nikiyama nkituaak oo loreren oo ltung'ana lena kop, kake ore ake o taata eetae osiligi too Siraeli hoo netii ena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore enkaraki ina, maitobira iyiook olning'o lo sotua o Enkai ang, aaiwuang'ie kuna kituaak pooki o nkera enye, te risioroto e nkikoo o lkitok lai, o ene lelo ooikirikira te nkaraki enkitanapata e Nkai ang: naa nchoo easi ina te risioroto e nkitanapata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tudumunye amu esiaai ino ina, nikitii iyiook tenebo iyie. Ntagoluoyu nias ina.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nedumunye Esra neinosie olmumai ilapolosak kituaak, o Lawi o Siraeli pooki, pee eas anaa enatejoki. Neinos ninche olmumai.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki Esra alo te nkaji e Nkai nelo olgilata le Yehobadan olayioni le Eliaship, naa ine eshomo airrag. Neitu einos endaa anaa eok enkare; amu eishiraka apa ninye lelo ooshomo eyararoto lemeisiligayu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitayuni enkitanapata tiatua Yuda pooki o Yerusalem tenkaraki lelo yararot pooki ootorrinyunye, pee epuo ninche aaiturrurro te Yerusalem. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa teneitu elotu oltung'ani ake ninye obo too nkolong'i uni, te nkitanapata oo lkituaak o lpayiani, ore imasaa enyena pooki, neyai, ore ninye makewan, neiwuang'ieki te umata o yararot ootorrinyunye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore iltung'ana pooki le Yuda o Benchamen, neiturrurro te Yerusalem too nkolong'i uni, naa olapa lioudo apa ilo e nkolong e tikitam o lapa. Netoni iltung'ana pooki to lkurroto otumoreki te dukuya enkaji e Nkai, eikirikira te nkaraki ena bae o tenkaraki enchan sapuk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitashe Esra ilo apolosani nejoki ninche, “Itigila intae inkitanapat niyama nkituaak oo loreren, nitoponaitie enkitarrurroto te Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore naa taata entobira enkirridunoto to Laitoriani Enkai oo loo papaai linyi, niasiasa eyieunoto enye. Entegelari maate entung'uai iltung'ana lena kop, ning'uaa nkituaak enye.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Newal eumata pooki to ltoilo sapuk aajo, “Neijia etiu, meeta nchere keitu iyiook kiaas anaa enitejo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake aikumok iltung'ana, naa erishata e nchan sapuk, mikindim iyiook aaitasho tena kisiajata. Ore sii ena siaai, neme ene nkolong nabo anaa nkolong'i are, amu kintarruoitie iyiook oleng tena bae. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nchoo ilkituaak lang eitashe te rishata e umata pooki, naa nchoo pooki tiatua nkanas ang apa oowaita nkituaak oo loreren epuonu too rishat naategeluaki, ore ilpayiani o larishak te pooki anasa neaku tenebo ninche, ometaba anaa neibelekenya engoro napi e Nkai ang aing'uaa iyiook.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yonatan ake olayioni le Asahel o Yohaseia olayioni le Tikfa otanya ena, ore Meshulam o Shebetai, ilo le Lawi, neibung'are ninche.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neas lelo yarunot apa ootorrinyunye ina. Negelu Esra olapolosani iltung'ana, ilukuny oo nkajijik oo loo menye, te risioroto oo nkajijik oo loo menye, ore ake pooki ng'ae te ninche neigeri enkarna enye. Ore te nkolong e dukuya o lapa le tomon netoni ninche pee ejurru ina bae. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore te nkolong e dukuya o lapa le dukuya nebau ninche eneiting'ie lelo lewa apa ooyama nkituaak oo loreren.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Iltung'ana apa oata nkituaak oo loreren",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore too layiok loo lapolosak apa ooyama nkituaak oo loreren, netumi, Maaseia, o Eliesa, o Yarib, o Gedaia, loo layiok le Yeshua olayioni le Yosadak, o lalashera lenyena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Etonyorraitie ninche maate pee eiwuang'ie nena kituaak enye oo loreren, ore apa olasar lenye le nkitarruorroto naa olmeregesh le luaata oo ntare te nkaraki enkitarrurroto enye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore too layiok le Imer netumi Hanani o Sebadia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore too layiok le Harim, netumi Maaseia, o Eliya, o Shemaia, o Yehiel o Usia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore too layiok le Pashur: netumi Elioenai, o Maaseia, o Ishmael, o Natanael o Yosabad, o Elasa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore too Lawi: netumi Yosabad o Shimei o Kelaia, (aa taa Kelita) o Petahia, o Yuda, O Eliesa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore too laranyak, netumi: Eliashib. Ore too larripok loo nchomito netumi: Shalum, o Telem, o Uri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore te Israel: too layiok le Parosh netumi: Ramia, o Isia, o Malkija, o Mijamin, o Eleasa, o Hashabia o Benaia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
